@model Fanex.Affiliate.User.Core.ViewModels.RevenueSharingStructureViewModel
<div class="content-group">
    <div class="title-container">
        <div class="index-number">01</div>
        <div class="title-block">
            <div class="title"><span>What we have</span></div>
            <div class="button-toggle"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block">
        <ul>
            <li><p>Top-notch gaming and online betting products such as Sports, Live Casino, Virtual Sports, Keno, Slot games, plus a wide selection of games</p></li>
            <li><p>Renowned brand with over 2 languages so it is easier for you to attract members</p></li>
            <li><p>Strategic Marketing tools ensuring high member conversion and retention rate</p></li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="content-group">
    <div class="title-container">
        <div class="index-number">02</div>
        <div class="title-block">
            <div class="title"><span>What we offer</span></div>
            <div class="button-toggle"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block">
        <ul>
            <li><p>Up to @Model.MaxCommission revenue share rate</p></li>
            <li><p>An addition of 10% – recruit friends to join our Affiliate program as your sub-affiliate and get your reward!</p></li>
            <li><p>Effective and easy-to-use management system for your performance tracking</p></li>
            <li><p>Friendly and professional affiliate team always ready to assist you</p></li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="content-group">
    <div class="title-container">
        <div class="index-number">03</div>
        <div class="title-block">
            <div class="title"><span>Our Plan</span></div>
            <div class="button-toggle"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block">
        <p>Your revenue share consists of two parts: (i) from your referred player’s betting losses and (ii) from your referred affiliate’s revenue share:</p>
        <p><strong>i. Regular Commission Structure:</strong></p>
        @{ Html.RenderPartial($"~/Views/CommissionStructure/_RevenueShareTable.cshtml", Model.MaxCommission); }
        <p class="text">Example:</p>
        <p class="text"><i><strong>Positive Revenue</strong></i></p>
        <div>
            <p class="text">Gross Revenue = VND 3,000,000,000</p>
            <p class="text">Bonus Expenses = VND 65,000,000</p>
            <p class="text">Transaction Fees = VND 30,000,000</p>
            <p class="text">Royalty Fees = VND 265,000,000</p>
            <p class="text">Commission = </p>
            <p class="text">(Gross Revenue - Bonus Expenses - Transaction Fees - Royalty Fees) x Revenue Share %</p>
            <p class="text">(3,000,000,000 - 65,000,000 - 30,000,000 - 265,000,000) × 50% = VND 1,320,000,000</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text"><i><strong>Negative Revenue</strong></i></p>
        <div>
            <p class="text">Gross revenue = - VND 100,000,000</p>
            <p class="text">Member’s bonus = VND 10,000,000</p>
            <p class="text">Transaction Fees = VND 6,000,000</p>
            <p class="text">Commission = </p>
            <p class="text">(Gross Revenue - Bonus Expenses - Transaction Fees) x Revenue Share %</p>
            <p class="text">(-100,000,000 - 10,000,000 - 6,000,000) × 25% = VND -29,000,000 (Carry forward to following month)</p>
        </div>
        <p><strong>Company’s Net Profit:</strong> The actual profit remaining from the monthly net loss of all players recommended by you to Bwing after deducting all related costs.</p>
        <p><strong>Qualified Player:</strong> Members with at least VND 2,600,000 in wagering turnover per calendar month.</p>
        <p>Negative revenue share for any given month will be carried forward to the following month.</p>
        <p>All affiliates are subject to administrative and marketing costs incurred directly for the acquisition of members.</p>
        <p>The cost deducted from the revenue on a monthly basis. This cost may include the following:</p>
        <ul class="dash-style">
            <li>
                <strong>Banking Fee</strong> - Deposit and Withdrawal charges for each involving all the affiliate's customers.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Royalty Fee</strong> - Product royalty fees incurred involving all affiliate customers.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Promotion bonuses</strong> - Monetary bonuses or rebates given to the affiliate customers.
            </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            <strong>ii. Sub-Affiliate Structure:</strong> you will be eligible to receive an extra 10% from your referred affiliates’ revenue share,
            and as long as they bring other affiliates in, you can also have a share from their sub-affiliates’ revenue share either!
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="content-group">
    <div class="title-container">
        <div class="index-number">04</div>
        <div class="title-block">
            <div class="title"><span>Revenue Share Payout Example</span></div>
            <div class="button-toggle"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block">
        <p><strong>Figure 1:</strong> An example to show you how your revenue share earned from your referred players is calculated</p>
        @{ Html.RenderPartial($"~/Views/CommissionStructure/_ExampleTable.cshtml", Model); }
        <p><strong>Figure 2:</strong> An example to show you how your revenue share earned from your referred affiliates (and their sub-affiliates) is calculated</p>
        <div class="img-support" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 15px auto;">
            <img class="img-responsive" src="~/www/build/styles/Images/revenue-share-structure/@(Model.SiteName)/revenue-share.@(Model.CurrentLanguage).png" alt="hierarchy banner" />
        </div>
        <p>Your revenue share earned from the referred affiliates:</p>
        <div>
            <p class="text">
                = [B1+ ((C1 + C2) * 10%)]*10% + [B2 * 10%]
            </p>
            <p class="text">
                = [0 + (1,150,000,000 + 690,000,000) * 10%)]*10% + [1,610,000,000 * 10%]
            </p>
            <p class="text">
                = VND 179,400,000
            </p>
        </div>
        <p>
            <strong>=></strong> Your total revenue share for the month would be: 1,336,250,000 + 179,400,000 = <strong>VND 1,515,650,000</strong>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="content-group">
    <div class="title-container">
        <div class="index-number">05</div>
        <div class="title-block">
            <div class="title"><span>How we pay</span></div>
            <div class="button-toggle"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block">
        <ul>
            <li><p> Once a month, through your @(Model.SiteFriendlyName) player account (in VND) and the minimum withdrawal amount is VND 2,600,000.</p></li>
            <li><p>Any 2nd withdrawal request in the same month shall be subject to @Model.SiteFriendlyName Affiliates team’s approval.</p></li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

